---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — doxuanloc.space"
  description="Privacy policy for doxuanloc.space and its associated developer integrations."
>
  <section style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:80px">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size:2rem">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:.9rem">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:32px;display:grid;gap:28px">

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent-2);margin:0 0 10px">Overview</h2>
          <p>This is a personal portfolio site operated by Đỗ Xuân Lộc. It does not offer any product or service to end users, and does not collect, store, or process personal data from visitors.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent-2);margin:0 0 10px">Data Collection</h2>
          <p>This site collects no personal information. There are no sign-up forms, no user accounts, no tracking pixels, and no third-party analytics scripts.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:10px">Basic server access logs (IP address, request path, timestamp) may be retained by the hosting provider (Vercel) in accordance with <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vercel's Privacy Policy</a>. These logs are not accessed or used by the site owner for profiling or analytics.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent-2);margin:0 0 10px">Cookies</h2>
          <p>This site does not set any cookies for tracking or advertising. The hosting provider may set technical cookies necessary for CDN or security functions.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent-2);margin:0 0 10px">LinkedIn Integration</h2>
          <p>This site uses the LinkedIn API solely to publish content to the site owner's personal LinkedIn profile. The integration:</p>
          <ul style="margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:20px;display:grid;gap:6px">
            <li>Is operated exclusively by the site owner, not accessible to any third party.</li>
            <li>Does not collect, read, or store LinkedIn data belonging to any other user.</li>
            <li>Uses OAuth 2.0 tokens stored locally on the owner's machine and never transmitted to or stored on this site.</li>
            <li>Posts only content generated from this site's own blog pipeline.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent-2);margin:0 0 10px">Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p>This site may contain links to external websites. This privacy policy applies only to doxuanloc.space. Linked sites have their own privacy practices.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent-2);margin:0 0 10px">Contact</h2>
          <p>For any questions regarding this privacy policy, contact: <a href="mailto:do.xuanloc@marketenterprise.vn">do.xuanloc@marketenterprise.vn</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
